==Ammo Pickup==
'''Ammo Pickup''' refers to how much ammo is obtained from [[pickups]].

[[Area of Effect Weapons]] tend to have lower base Ammo Pickup than normal.

===Drop Chances===
Chance to drop Primary or Secondary Ammo scales with squad size:<ref>{{ver|32}} patch notes</ref>
*1 player squad = 45% (60% in [[Landscape]]s)
*2 player squad = 37.5% (52.5% in Landscapes)
*3 player squad = 30% (45% in Landscapes)
*4 player squad = 22.5% (37.5% in Landscape)

For most enemies, each roll of their drop table will only result in a maximum of one Ammo Pickup.

[[Eximus]] are guaranteed to drop either a Primary or Secondary Ammo, each having the same chance of dropping. This does not overwrite the enemies normal chance of dropping an Ammo pickup.

